    "你扫描的材料里经常出现、但还没看过讲解的语法。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Grammar that shows up often in what you scan but you haven't read yet."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Gramática que aparece a menudo en lo que escaneas y que aún no has leído."
          }
        },
        "ko": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "스캔한 자료에 자주 나오지만 아직 설명을 보지 않은 문법입니다."
          }
        },
        "my": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "သင် စကင်ဖတ်တဲ့ စာတွေထဲမှာ မကြာခဏ ပါပေမယ့် ရှင်းလင်းချက် မဖတ်ရသေးတဲ့ သဒ္ဒါများ။"
          }
        },
        "vi": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ngữ pháp xuất hiện nhiều trong tài liệu bạn quét nhưng bạn chưa xem."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "你扫描的材料里经常出现、但还没看过讲解的语法。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "你掃描的材料裡經常出現、但還沒看過講解的語法。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
