    "按遗忘曲线安排，点开回顾一遍即完成复习。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Spaced by the forgetting curve. Open one to review it."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Organizado según la curva del olvido. Ábrelo para repasarlo."
          }
        },
        "ko": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "망각 곡선에 맞춰 배치했습니다. 열어서 한 번 보면 복습 완료."
          }
        },
        "my": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "မေ့လျော့မှုမျဉ်းကွေးအလိုက် စီစဉ်ထားပါတယ်။ ဖွင့်ပြီး တစ်ခေါက် ပြန်ကြည့်ရင် ပြီးပါပြီ။"
          }
        },
        "vi": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Sắp xếp theo đường cong lãng quên. Mở ra xem lại là hoàn thành."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "按遗忘曲线安排，点开回顾一遍即完成复习。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "按遺忘曲線安排，點開回顧一遍即完成複習。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "按遗忘曲线排序：最快要忘记的排在最前面。点开回顾一遍即完成复习。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ordered by the forgetting curve: what you're closest to forgetting comes first. Open one to review it."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ordenado por la curva del olvido: lo que estás más cerca de olvidar va primero. Ábrelo para repasarlo."
          }
        },
        "ko": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "망각 곡선 순서: 가장 먼저 잊을 문법이 맨 위에 있습니다. 열어서 한 번 보면 복습 완료."
          }
        },
        "my": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "မေ့လျော့မှုမျဉ်းကွေးအလိုက် စီထားပါတယ်- အမေ့နီးဆုံး သဒ္ဒါက ထိပ်ဆုံးမှာ ရှိပါတယ်။ ဖွင့်ပြီး တစ်ခေါက် ပြန်ကြည့်ရင် ပြန်လေ့လာမှု ပြီးပါပြီ။"
          }
        },
        "vi": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Sắp xếp theo đường cong lãng quên: mẫu sắp quên nhất ở trên cùng. Mở ra xem lại là hoàn thành."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "按遗忘曲线排序：最快要忘记的排在最前面。点开回顾一遍即完成复习。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "按遺忘曲線排序：最快要忘記的排在最前面。點開回顧一遍即完成複習。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
