    "没有相机权限。\n请在「设置」中允许访问相机，或从相册选择图片。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "No camera access.\nAllow camera access in Settings, or choose a photo instead."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Sin acceso a la cámara.\nPermite el acceso en Ajustes o elige una foto."
          }
        },
        "ko": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "카메라 권한이 없습니다.\n설정에서 카메라 접근을 허용하거나 사진을 선택하세요."
          }
        },
        "my": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "ကင်မရာ သုံးခွင့် မရှိပါ။\nဆက်တင်များတွင် ကင်မရာ သုံးခွင့်ပေးပါ သို့မဟုတ် ဓာတ်ပုံတစ်ပုံ ရွေးပါ။"
          }
        },
        "vi": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Chưa có quyền dùng camera.\nHãy cho phép trong Cài đặt hoặc chọn ảnh từ thư viện."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "没有相机权限。\n请在「设置」中允许访问相机，或从相册选择图片。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "沒有相機許可權。\n請在「設定」中允許訪問相機，或從相簿選擇圖片。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
